# Apple Walnut Salad

# Ingredients

2 Apples, medium to large Granny Smith, sliced
1 Red Onion, small, sliced into rings
1 Bag Romain Lettuce, cut
1 Bag Baby Field Greens Lettuce
Craisins
8 ounces Gorgonzola Blue Cheese

## Dressing
- Olive Oil
- Red Wine Vinaigrette
- Oregano
- Sugar...
- 2 Juice of Lemons

# Method

1. Dice 3-4 slices of Red Onion.
1. Soak Red Onion in a small dish of cold water to get rid of the sharpness.
1. In a very large mixing bowl, add both bags of Lettuce, Craisins, half the Candied Walnuts, half the Apples, half the Blue Cheese, and Dressing.
1. Toss.
1. Arrange remaining Apple slices around the edge of the salad bowl.
1. Sprinkle the remaining Blue Cheese in the center of the salad bowl.
1. Sprinkle the remaining Candied Walnuts over eveything.
1. Serve with tongs.
